      "content": "But the silence there... it's so much quieter than the struggle. Looking down into that nothingness, it doesn't feel scary. It feels like the only thing that actually makes sense. Like the whole point of the walk was just to reach this stillness. Does it really make sense to keep walking when the destination is just more noise and fog?",
